  "asset_base": "https://roocdb.com/professions/",
  "discovered": "2026-10-23 — ROOCDB (roocdb.com, fan database 'extracted straight from the game') hosts the game's own class imagery under stable, un-hashed URLs: the per-job class-emblem icons (professions/UI_Common_Profession_Icon_<n>.webp) and the per-job full-body class art (professions/hero/<id>_<gender>.webp, 1197×1309; the Gunslinger line is lower-res: 9102 female 388×388 / male 392×484). This replaces the 2026-10-16 discovery from roocamer.gnjoy.game (whose file.joymaker.com CDN URLs are vite-hash-brittle and whose icon set was only the SEVEN base-role icons — classes sharing a line shared an icon, Rebellion had none at all). Mapping gathered 2026-10-23 by walking the live ROOCDB class pages (base button → EVOLUÇÕES buttons, reading each button's <img> src+alt).",
